{"name":"-51-3-10","beats":[{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"black","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOn","value":"0,10","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"Gunfight","raw":"SE2"},{"type":"background","value":"2022winter_BlackArea_1","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"shake","raw":"震屏3"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Cloak_Whoosh","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"GF_21summer_intro_DemonVariation","raw":"BGM"},{"type":"fadePointOff","raw":"黑点2"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Bullets, cannonfire, close-range assaults... Grig skillfully handles all these attacks."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Bullte_Ricochet","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_20Winter_Knife_Whoosh","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The sabre in her hand is almost like a natural extension of her body, nimbly executing attacks and parries. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"She seems to be taking it in stride, but however flawless her swordsmanship is, it's hard-pressed to stop an endless stream of concentrated attacks..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"Explode","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"background","value":"black","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Kaboom! The gunshots are immediately followed by an explosion at close range."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_tinnitus_0","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Clods of dirt fly into the air as Grig is blasted down a slope by the concussion. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The shrill ringing in her ear turns murky and indistinct, like she's sinking into deep water, while bright and dark spots begin dancing through her vision..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-grig","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"shake","value":"0.1","raw":"Shake"}],"speaker":"Grig","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_whitenoise","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Grig tries to prop herself up with her sabre, but her hand just can't seem to reach it. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Upon a closer look, she realizes that she no longer has her dominant hand."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Without any hesitation, Grig switches to her other hand and tries to prop herself up again."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-grig","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Grig","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Gray..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"As light and darkness criss-cross intermittently through her field of vision, several indistinct figures reach out toward her, like drops of ink spreading through water..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"Gunfight","raw":"SE2"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The whizzing of bullets sounds like a gentle breeze to Grig, whose reflexes have slowed dramatically. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Still, she holds on to her sabre, like a knight that will never fall."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-grig","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Grig","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"We... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"...will meet again... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"In Avernus..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Grig raises her weapon with her remaining arm, its edge reflects her keen, indomitable gaze."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"2022winter_BlackArea_1","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...In the Black Zone. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"RO635 and company have followed Squad Ferrum and Squad Nitrogen into the \"Dead Sea\". "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"With the information from Mona, Squad Umbrella soon becomes used to the bizarre terrain of the Black Zone and they begin their pursuit as planned."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"GF_22W_BGM_2","raw":"BGM"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_tele_connect","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Nitrogen, Ferrum, be advised, we've entered the \"Dead Sea\" as well."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"Gunfight","raw":"SE2"}],"speaker":"Mona","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Copy, we've engaged Grig in combat, but there's no sign of Morridow or Gray. We'll contact you later.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Though they aren't in the conference room, RO can still hear the sound of intense gunfire coming from Mona's side."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Grig... Got it."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD IIMod","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_tele_disconnect","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"RO, there aren't any traces here, what should we do?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"UMP45Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"UMP45","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Morridow's signal has long since left the effective radius."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Grig was probably left behind to delay them. Mona and the others are fighting her. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Looks like we've lost track of our target..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Having lost their lead once again, RO635 contemplates their next step."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"XM8MOD","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"XM8","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Leader, do you remember the abandoned outpost I guided you to?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"XM8MOD","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"RO635Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I remember. There were many signs of Paradeus activity there."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"XM8MOD","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"RO635Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"XM8","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"While I was waiting for you, I did a bit of looking around. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Turns out there were once comm frequencies for other outposts saved in its database."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"XM8MOD","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"RO635Mod","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The presence of multiple outposts means they're built to surround some key structure... Can you find the next outpost?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"XM8MOD","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"XM8","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Outposts need to check in regularly with their HQ, which means they have comms equipment."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"UMP45Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"UMP45","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"And if they send a signal, we can detect it..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Then we can approach our objective while causing minimal disturbance. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Can you pick up any signals, 45?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"UMP45Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_keyboardtype_sci","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"UMP45","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Already on it."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"UMP45 and UMP9 immediately begin looking for clues concerning the outposts. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"XM8 begins extrapolating the location of the other outposts from her existing data."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Geiger_Counter","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"All their instruments are being affected by disruption from the radiation, which is visible to the naked eye. RO635 can't help but let out a little sigh."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635Mod","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The radiation level here is just too high."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"UMP45Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"UMP45","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It's a limitation for us, but also for them. The equipment they can use is very limited."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_The_Division_Baggage_bomb_Activation","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Beep. The device in UMP45's hand makes a noise."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Did you find anything?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"UMP9Mod","expression":6,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"UMP9","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Just a rough direction... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I don't know if it's because of distance or because of the radiation, but the signal is very weak."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Let's search in this direction first."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD IIMod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I just scouted the nearby terrain. I'll lead the way!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOn","raw":"黑点1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOff","raw":"黑点2"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Team_Running","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The heavy greenish fog obscures their vision, and the uneven terrain beneath their feet tries to trip them up. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"After entering the Black Zone, what was once mushy dirt has hardened into solid monoliths, which makes walking that much more difficult. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"After factoring in the complex terrain and radiation disruption, the Dolls are moving far slower than they did in the Red Zone."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"UMP9Mod","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"UMP9","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Weird, how come we've only traveled this far after walking for so long?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD IIMod","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I plotted a straight-line course for us!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"XM8, whose head has been bowed all this time, suddenly looks up."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"XM8MOD","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"XM8","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"My chess sense tells me that we're close."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"UMP45Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"UMP45","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Frankly speaking, if it were any further, we'd be out of signal reception range."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"UMP9Mod","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"UMP9","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"But where is it...?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"(Rustle)"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The Dolls immediately duck behind one of the standing rocks that are everywhere and cautiously poke their heads out."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_tele_connect","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Open the short-range squad channel.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD IIMod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Won't the enemy overhear us?","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"UMP45Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"UMP45","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The squad channel established by RO has a very limited range, so the enemy won't be able to pick it up from a distance.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"UMP9Mod","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"UMP9","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What was that noise? It sounded like something was driving over a road...","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"XM8MOD","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"XM8","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I see headlights!","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Moto_Run","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"On the dark path, a pair of small headlights cut through the gloom."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It's a cargo truck, we're at the right place.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD IIMod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Are we going to intercept it? That way we'll have a vehicle!","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"No, we can't alert the enemy to our presence now.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Five pairs of eyes follow every move the truck makes, and soon the small lights vanish in a direction leading away from the \"Dead Sea\"."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"XM8MOD","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"XM8","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Leader, over there!","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"2022winter_BlackArea_2","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"XM8's finger is trembling in excitement as she points toward the direction where she first spotted the truck. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Through the darkness, a gray building is visible above the black rocks."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"XM8MOD","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"XM8","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...That should be an outpost.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635Mod","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Correct.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"RO635 quickly tamps down her excitement."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"UMP9Mod","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"UMP9","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It's true...","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD IIMod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"So what do we do now?","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"We capture the outpost while keeping an eye on our target and doing our best not to draw the enemy's attention.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"SOP-II, you're on point with me.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"45 and 9, follow us. XM8, you'll cover our rear and keep an eye out for enemy reinforcements. ","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"The Squad","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Roger!","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"black","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Team_Running","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Moving under the cover of the gloomy sky, the five-man team feels their way toward the sentry post..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOff","raw":"黑点2"},{"type":"shake","raw":"震屏3"},{"type":"background","value":"2022winter_BlackArea_1","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"bgm","value":"10230","raw":"BGM"},{"type":"sfx","value":"Explode","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Gunfire","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Boom!!! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Under the fire support of Gager and Architect, the already-suppressed Paradeus forces are promptly decimated. Meanwhile, Rhino and Mona's coordinated fire clears them up swiftly."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-grig","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"shake","value":"0.1","raw":"Shake"}],"speaker":"Grig","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Urgh!","style":{"size":"50"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Grig is already struggling to fully utilize her abilities on the uneven terrain, but under Architect's wild bombardment, her speed is greatly hindered as she stumbles and staggers. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"With her movement radius steadily curtailed, even the fog can no longer hide her."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"QBZ191","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"Select","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"No. 9","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"This is our chance!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Gatling_gun","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"shake","value":"%%type_id=2%%duration=3%%delay=0.1%%range=8","raw":"controll_shake"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"And just as she reveals an opening, No. 9—who has had her eyes on Grig all this time—seizes the opportunity to empty her magazine into her."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-grig","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"shake","value":"0.1","raw":"Shake"}],"speaker":"Grig","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"—?!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_20Winter_Knife_Whoosh","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Bullte_Ricochet","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Grig is unable to evade in time, so she raises her sabre, trying to swat the bullets away with brute force. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"However, in the very next moment, a figure that fills her with despair already has her cannon trained on her."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"BOSS-9","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_weapon_reload","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"Architect","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Yoohoo~ "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"According to Agent, you like being treated like this, no?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-grig","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Grig","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"!!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrat